{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mewts</strong> is a <strong>top-down party game</strong> for up to <strong>4 players online or local.</strong> <br>In the centre of the game are intense competitive game modes where you fight it out as these silly creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/c65c0806aad24c4492256a368cc2623e.poster.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1058 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/c65c0806aad24c4492256a368cc2623e.webm?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/c65c0806aad24c4492256a368cc2623e.mp4?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ecd70ef7358f870242775c7858ef193a.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1560 height=271 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.poster.avif?t=1765482296\" width=500 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.webm?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.mp4?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>They grab things, they flop and wobble</strong> (It adds to their personality)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ed78155888caff248e131f7391381232.avif?t=1765482296\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras_big/ed78155888caff248e131f7391381232.webp?t=1765482296 width=1560 height=277 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/1ee606979d33208d987ac4b8a0db744c.poster.avif?t=1765482296\" width=500 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/1ee606979d33208d987ac4b8a0db744c.webm?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/1ee606979d33208d987ac4b8a0db744c.mp4?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<strong>Brawls, races, team games. </strong>From \u201cfriendly\u201d competitions to absolute chaos!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/1ab14a91b53043bd0eb7857af91dc82a.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1560 height=281 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/90d05eb6eaeb3f9da81dd12b9c559ea8.poster.avif?t=1765482296\" width=500 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/90d05eb6eaeb3f9da81dd12b9c559ea8.webm?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/90d05eb6eaeb3f9da81dd12b9c559ea8.mp4?t=1765482296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you're right next to each other or you\u2019re separated by the sea, you get to slingshot bombs in your faces</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ed9e3934cfc13e75ac5c75f635cfa57b.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1560 height=291 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are more of a recommendation but still they are simulated and applied here to everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/0f487e979f36091777a75578e9701f59.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1560 height=266 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything looks like it was built in a playroom from clay</strong> (because it was)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/6e64b3638aefb22682ed21efdd3f1206.avif?t=1765482296\" width=1560 height=306 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>Unless you\u2019re some kind of Mewt-whisperer. Then we\u2019re scared of you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So get your friends and wiggle your way to victory!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ed78155888caff248e131f7391381232.avif?t=1765482296\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras_big/ed78155888caff248e131f7391381232.webp?t=1765482296 width=1560 height=277 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Slingball</strong> you try to get a ball in a goal using your stretching and visceral assault of other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Brawl</strong> it\u2019s just the assault of other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>King of the Hill</strong> **you risk everything to be the one collecting the points but everyone gets to bully you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Race</strong> you uh, well, assault other players and also race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 And in <strong>Greedy Mewts</strong> teams compete in how many balls they get to steal for themselves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939660?t=1765482296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939660?t=1765482296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/6c9a3d06cab4f72784bea87216631befb4d95595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765482296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/6c9a3d06cab4f72784bea87216631befb4d95595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765482296","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mewts</strong> is a <strong>top-down party game</strong> for up to <strong>4 players online or local.</strong> <br>I